flowchart LR
    U[User prompt in browser] --> W[web/server.py]
    W --> P[src/query_parser.py]
    P --> G[Gemini structured JSON]
    G --> V[Validate preferences and retrieval fields]
    V --> R[src/rag.py<br/>TF-IDF + cosine similarity]
    F[data/songs_fma.csv] --> L[load_songs + catalog validation]
    L --> R
    R --> C[Top candidate tracks]
    C --> S[src/recommender.py<br/>deterministic score and rank]
    S --> Q[src/reliability.py<br/>output guardrail]
    Q --> J[JSON response with score and reasons]
    J --> W
    W --> B[web/index.html + app.js]

    M[data/fma_metadata] --> N[scripts/prepare_fma.py]
    N --> F
    E[scripts/evaluate_fma.py] --> R
    E --> S
